***Controller (Driver Controller):***
Button B: Reset Gyro
Left Trigger (hold): Slow Drive (0.5x speed)
Right Trigger: Drive To Shoot Vision
Button X: Switches to X Pattern
Button Y: Toggle Vision Enabled
Button A: Debug climb offset calc

***Controller1 (Operator Controller):***
Right Trigger: Run Shooter
Left Trigger: Run IntakeRoller
Button A: Deploy Intake (With PID)
Button B: Stow Intake (With PID)
Button X: Deploy Agitator
D PAD DOWN: Drop Robot off Climb
D PAD UP: Lift Robot Up Climb

**REMAINING BUTTONS THAT CAN BE BINDED FOR OPERATOR CONTROLLER**

Left Bumper

**Operator Right Bumper: Toggle Whip slow (RB press starts/stops at WHIP_SLOW_SPEED=0.2)**
